  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>Here is the shape of the hour. First I put the gateway in its world - shopper, merchant, gateway, bank. Then the two endpoints we expose. Then the main event: one payment request walked through eight stops in the order the code runs. After that I cover the cross-cutting concerns - errors, security, observability - then packaging, documentation and testing. Feel free to interrupt at any point; this is a conversation, not a lecture.</p>
